        "v": 5,
        "title": "CLI nextDelayMs handles premiumslottaken",
        "summary": "`nextDelayMs` in `cli/src/hooks/use-freebuff-session.ts` now returns `null` for `premium_slot_taken` alongside `model_locked`, `rate_limited`, and `model_unavailable`. This prevents invalid delay calculations when the CLI encounters a premium slot contention response. The change is scoped to the CLI session hook.",
